{'symbol': 'TXN', 'date': '2022-06-21 01:00:00', 'title': 'NEW BLUETOOTH® LE WIRELESS MCUS MAKE HIGH-QUALITY RF AND POWER PERFORMANCE MORE AFFORDABLE', 'text': "DALLAS , JUNE 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TEXAS INSTRUMENTS (TI) (NASDAQ: TXN) TODAY EXPANDED ITS CONNECTIVITY PORTFOLIO WITH A NEW FAMILY OF WIRELESS MICROCONTROLLERS (MCU) THAT ENABLE HIGH-QUALITY BLUETOOTH® LOW ENERGY (LE) AT HALF THE PRICE OF COMPETING DEVICES. FEATURING BEST-IN-CLASS STANDBY CURRENT AND RADIO-FREQUENCY (RF) PERFORMANCE, THE SIMPLELINK™ BLUETOOTH LE CC2340 FAMILY IS BUILT ON THE FOUNDATION OF TI'S DECADES OF WIRELESS CONNECTIVITY EXPERTISE."}